    "en": "A front-facing wheelie with an oversized foreground tire, rough black linework and a vivid red-orange comic poster palette.",
    "zh": "从极低正面机位描绘越野摩托翘头动作，以巨大的前轮、粗黑线条和鲜明红橙色呈现漫画海报张力。"
